  "body": "I'd like to start a conversation about text rendering on `OffscreenCanvas`.\r\n\r\nWith OffscreenCanvas implementations getting ready, I'd like us to see what we could do to on the spec side. Apart from removing that bullet point from `OffscreenCanvasRenderingContext2D`, I see a few points that potentially need to be spec'ed:\r\n\r\n- What to do regarding font resolution. Should OffscreenCanvas on the main thread resolve to the same fonts as Canvas (CSS + FontFace) or just FontFace? On the case of workers, it's always just FontFace, since there's no CSS fonts available.\r\n- What is the default for \"inherit/parent\" fonts and font attributes (mainly size, I think).\r\n\r\nAre there other considerations that would prevent us from moving forward with this?\r\n\r\n@whatwg/canvas ",
